WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.940
Treasure Island

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:09.680
<i>To keep an eye on Silver and his friends,</i>

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:13.030
<i>I'm put on one of the rowboats and set off for the island.</i>

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:18.630
<i>Once on land, I witness something horrible!</i>

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:44.320
<i>Silver coldly murders Egg-Head.</i>

00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:45.840
<i>Swiftly, with one blow!</i>

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:49.490
<i>It was the first time that I had seen Silver so cruel.</i>

00:00:49.490 --> 00:00:53.590
<i>Silver really was a terrible pirate!</i>

00:00:53.590 --> 00:00:58.080
<i>I-If Silver ever finds me, he...
He won't hesitate to kill me!</i>

00:00:58.080 --> 00:00:59.990
<i>He'll kill me!</i>

00:01:02.380 --> 00:01:05.940
Treasure
Island

00:01:02.380 --> 00:01:05.740
Takarajima

00:01:12.220 --> 00:01:14.550
saa ikou

00:01:12.220 --> 00:01:14.550
Come, let's go

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:17.640
yume ni mita shima heto

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:17.640
To the island that I've dreamed of

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:21.480
nami wo koete kaze ni notte

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:21.480
Across the waves, on the wind

00:01:21.730 --> 00:01:24.360
umi hedeyou

00:01:21.730 --> 00:01:24.360
We'll travel the oceans

00:01:24.770 --> 00:01:27.280
ikute ni wa

00:01:24.770 --> 00:01:27.280
Many of us

00:01:27.530 --> 00:01:30.280
minna mada shiranai

00:01:27.530 --> 00:01:30.280
Still don't know of

00:01:30.530 --> 00:01:34.030
fushigi na hiru to yoru toga

00:01:30.530 --> 00:01:34.030
The days and nights full of mystery

00:01:34.280 --> 00:01:36.530
matte iru darou

00:01:34.280 --> 00:01:36.530
That await us there

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:40.040
itsumo shinji you

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:40.040
We must always have trust

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:43.290
magokoro wo

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:43.290
And be sincere

00:01:43.790 --> 00:01:49.550
yuuki wo mune ni susumou yo

00:01:43.790 --> 00:01:49.550
And have courage in our hearts to move forward

00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:52.680
tade hitotsu no

00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:52.680
I only...

00:01:53.010 --> 00:01:56.100
akogare dake wa

00:01:53.010 --> 00:01:56.100
...have one desire

00:01:56.350 --> 00:01:58.390
doko no dare ni mo

00:01:56.350 --> 00:01:58.390
And no one...

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:05.100
kese wa shinai sa

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:05.100
...will ever take it away

00:02:08.900 --> 00:02:11.650
tade hitotsu no

00:02:08.900 --> 00:02:11.650
I only...

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:14.950
akogare dake wa

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:14.950
...have one desire

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:17.280
doko no dare ni mo

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:17.280
And no one...

00:02:17.580 --> 00:02:24.210
kese wa shinai sa

00:02:17.580 --> 00:02:24.210
...will ever take it away

00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:35.260
episode

00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:35.260
\h           It's There!

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:38.930
<i>He'll kill me! If Silver finds me,
he'll kill me!</i>

00:02:41.940 --> 00:02:43.430
<i>D-Darn!</i>

00:02:44.350 --> 00:02:45.260
Who goes there?

00:02:45.260 --> 00:02:47.770
Who goes there? Who goes there?
Someone there?

00:02:47.770 --> 00:02:48.930
Someone there?

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:51.230
Hey George, Morgan, Big Eyes.
Go see what it is.

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:51.900
Aye.

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:52.310
Aye.
Aye.

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:52.990
Aye!

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:06.410
I-It's Jim!

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:09.710
Filthy little brat...
This way, guys!

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:21.140
Wait, Jim!

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:21.140
Come back here!

00:03:26.030 --> 00:03:27.020
Damn!

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:28.860
That brat runs like a rabbit.

00:03:28.860 --> 00:03:30.520
Where did he go?

00:03:34.270 --> 00:03:35.380
Take this!

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:38.560
Hey, are you sure it was Jim?

00:03:38.560 --> 00:03:40.100
Sure it wasn't a monkey?

00:03:40.100 --> 00:03:42.370
No way!
My eye never lies!

00:03:42.370 --> 00:03:45.270
So when Silver killed Egg-Head...

00:03:45.270 --> 00:03:46.940
He's must've seen everything.

00:03:46.940 --> 00:03:48.750
What rotten luck...

00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:51.430
If he ever tells all this to Smollett...

00:03:51.430 --> 00:03:52.250
I know!

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:53.580
I'm telling you, what should we do?!

00:03:53.590 --> 00:03:55.260
You have an idea, George?

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:55.560
Thanks, Benbow!

00:03:56.840 --> 00:04:00.630
That's why he has to be caught before he can warn them...

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:02.790
...and then we'll bring him to Silver.

00:04:02.790 --> 00:04:05.160
If you have to, kill him.

00:04:08.730 --> 00:04:10.060
H-He's over there!

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:11.080
Get him!

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:18.860
Wait, Jim!

00:04:24.270 --> 00:04:27.330
Strange...
I'm sure he came this way.

00:04:28.010 --> 00:04:30.910
Alright, we'll cover more ground if we split up.

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:31.780
Let's go!

00:04:47.730 --> 00:04:48.890
It's Jim!
He's over there!

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:09.310
Filthy brat!

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:34.110
It's a dead end. Turn around! We must've screwed up!

00:05:34.110 --> 00:05:35.000
Yeah!

00:05:41.760 --> 00:05:43.240
<i>I'm saved!</i>

00:05:43.240 --> 00:05:46.400
<i>But I must be careful.
I'm in trouble if they find me again.</i>

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:49.510
<i>All this, because I saw everything.</i>

00:05:49.510 --> 00:05:53.420
<i>Given the situation, Silver will likely want to take the initiative!</i>

00:05:53.760 --> 00:05:55.910
<i>No, maybe he already has.</i>

00:05:56.280 --> 00:05:58.250
<i>That's why I must hurry back to the ship...</i>

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:02.710
<i>...to warn Mr. Trelawney,
Dr. Livesey and Captain Smollett.</i>

00:06:07.480 --> 00:06:08.220
Let's go!

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:21.520
M-M-Monster...
It's a monster!

00:06:33.650 --> 00:06:34.870
Damn!

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:37.830
Wait! Please wait.
Please don't shoot!

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:39.840
I-It spoke?!

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:43.040
Wh-Who are you?!

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:52.870
Y-You really are a monster!

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:56.970
D-Don't shoot. You have nothing to be afraid of.

00:06:56.970 --> 00:07:00.940
I know that you're shocked, but I assure you I'm a man.

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:07.900
But it's been so long.
It's been so long since...

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:09.860
...I saw another human!

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:15.560
T-Tell me who you are!

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:16.290
I am Ben Gunn.

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:17.120
Ben Gunn?

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:20.580
Yes, I am poor Ben Gunn.

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:22.920
I haven't talked to anyone in ten years.

00:07:22.920 --> 00:07:24.040
T-Ten years?

00:07:24.780 --> 00:07:26.840
Then, were you shipwrecked?

00:07:26.840 --> 00:07:28.840
No, I was marooned.

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:31.320
Marooned?
So you're a pirate!

00:07:31.320 --> 00:07:34.800
No, w-wait!
Wait, please!

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:38.160
It's true, ten years ago,
 I was under the orders of Flint.

00:07:38.160 --> 00:07:39.520
Flint?

00:07:40.360 --> 00:07:43.480
Wait, are you part of Flint's crew?

00:07:43.960 --> 00:07:47.360
Of course not. I'm not one of those damn pirates.

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:49.440
Besides, Flint is dead.

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:52.600
Dead? Flint is dead?

00:07:52.600 --> 00:07:55.410
Captain Flint, dead...

00:07:55.760 --> 00:07:58.570
Really? Really.

00:07:58.570 --> 00:08:00.800
He's finally in hell?

00:08:00.800 --> 00:08:03.000
They must've been waiting on him for years!

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:05.030
But some of Flint's men are here.

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:10.350
Wh-Where are they?

00:08:10.350 --> 00:08:14.380
They were on our ship.
But now, they're on the island.

00:08:15.130 --> 00:08:19.020
I-I-Is there a one-legged man with them?

00:08:19.550 --> 00:08:20.890
John Silver!

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:23.770
Sil... Sil... Sil...

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:30.690
Please, you have to help me. I beg you.

00:08:30.690 --> 00:08:33.990
I don't want to deal with pirates.

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:37.190
If Silver finds me, I can't imagine what he'll do to me.

00:08:37.190 --> 00:08:39.160
I beg you, help.

00:08:40.470 --> 00:08:43.830
Alright!
I'll talk to Captain Smollett.

00:08:47.760 --> 00:08:51.760
Yes... that's a nice fort.
It's a perfect hideout.

00:08:52.400 --> 00:08:54.920
Surely the work of a great old pirate.

00:08:54.920 --> 00:08:57.260
It's in a good spot and seems very strong.

00:08:57.680 --> 00:09:03.180
If things go wrong, we can hold out at least a month against them.

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:04.520
"If things go wrong"?

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:08.190
Don't tell me you think Smollett and his crew expect something?

00:09:08.190 --> 00:09:11.150
It's very possible that they
already have their suspicions.

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:13.440
That's not good at all!

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:15.110
If that's the case, then...

00:09:15.110 --> 00:09:17.120
It's "possible", I said!

00:09:17.120 --> 00:09:21.430
No one knows what the future holds.

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:24.760
Well, if there's a problem,

00:09:24.760 --> 00:09:28.040
Hands will send a smoke signal from the ship.

00:09:32.640 --> 00:09:33.840
Heads!

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:35.440
Damn, I lost!

00:09:35.440 --> 00:09:37.880
Come on, who's turn is it?

00:09:37.880 --> 00:09:40.350
What's this, no one?

00:09:41.080 --> 00:09:44.310
Hey you, guy who never smiles,
wha d'ya say?

00:09:47.270 --> 00:09:50.720
Hey!
Answer when you're spoken to!

00:09:50.720 --> 00:09:53.190
He's not nice at all, that one.

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:54.140
Right?

00:09:58.000 --> 00:10:01.480
Let's go again, I'll clear all your debts.

00:10:01.480 --> 00:10:03.040
We'll start at zero.

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:04.290
Really?

00:10:04.740 --> 00:10:06.500
Come on, let's go!

00:10:06.840 --> 00:10:08.460
Trelawney...

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:11.210
Get this, Dr. Livesey.

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:14.990
It seems that Hands and his friends are staying on board to watch us.

00:10:14.990 --> 00:10:15.820
Indeed.

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:20.840
The Captain has something important to say. Let's round everyone up.

00:10:20.840 --> 00:10:22.390
Very well.

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:31.650
Wh-What?!
You want to attack now?

00:10:31.650 --> 00:10:37.110
That's why I let all those
who wanted to, disembark.

00:10:37.720 --> 00:10:40.990
The enemy is small in number.
This is our chance!

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:45.960
According to Flint's map,

00:10:45.960 --> 00:10:48.670
not very far from the bay we're in...

00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:51.500
...is a fort.
There,

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:54.750
we'll carry weapons,
food and ammunition.

00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:58.160
What? Don't we want to stay on the ship to fight?

00:10:58.160 --> 00:11:03.120
We shouldn't. The ship is very low on drinking water, Trelawney.

00:11:03.120 --> 00:11:06.310
That's right, I completely forgot.

00:11:06.310 --> 00:11:08.220
This fort was surely...

00:11:08.220 --> 00:11:11.680
...used by Flint or another pirate like him.

00:11:11.680 --> 00:11:15.230
Therefore, a river or a water source must be nearby.

00:11:15.640 --> 00:11:20.150
Additionally, it's probably placed in a strategic location.

00:11:20.600 --> 00:11:22.420
That'd make sense!

00:11:23.880 --> 00:11:26.000
I prefer ship combat,

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:28.830
but if they cut the ropes, it's all over.

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:32.590
Indeed.
I understand, Captain Smollett.

00:11:32.590 --> 00:11:36.300
I'll leave the matter of how we are to face Silver completely in your hands.

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:40.220
Then before anything,
we have to bind Hands' crew...

00:11:40.220 --> 00:11:43.930
...and load weapons, food and
ammunition into the rowboats.

00:11:59.940 --> 00:12:00.950
There!

00:12:01.340 --> 00:12:03.570
So guys, heads or tails?

00:12:04.580 --> 00:12:05.970
Come, go on!

00:12:06.310 --> 00:12:07.280
It's tails!

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:08.200
Lost again!

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:18.920
Hey, what's up old timer?
You want to join us?

00:12:19.760 --> 00:12:22.420
Don't talk such nonsense! That's a game for villains!

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:25.720
Th-The captain is summoning you all to his cabin.

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:28.480
Really, the captain?

00:12:33.180 --> 00:12:35.400
Let's go, mates!
The captain is asking for us.

00:12:43.020 --> 00:12:46.440
We're here captain.
What can we do for you?

00:12:46.440 --> 00:12:48.370
Please come in.

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:56.960
C-Captain!

00:13:00.120 --> 00:13:02.860
C-Captain, what is the meaning of this?

00:13:02.860 --> 00:13:06.170
Put your hands above your head
and get in line!

00:13:06.170 --> 00:13:09.680
We know you're planning a mutiny!

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:14.120
What? A-A mutiny?
Y-You must be joking, Captain.

00:13:14.120 --> 00:13:16.520
I know nothing of a mutiny...

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:20.610
Don't play me for a fool!
I know Silver is your leader!

00:13:22.760 --> 00:13:25.450
Now you lot, get in line and be quick about it!

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:30.740
Redruth, search them
and take their weapons.

00:13:30.740 --> 00:13:31.370
Y-Yes, sir.

00:13:40.120 --> 00:13:41.250
D-Darn!

00:13:42.160 --> 00:13:45.220
If you care about this old man, throw down your weapons!

00:13:46.460 --> 00:13:48.270
D-Damn it!

00:13:48.900 --> 00:13:51.400
S-S-Sir, don't worry about me!

00:13:51.400 --> 00:13:55.230
I told you to put down your weapons.
Hurry up!

00:13:58.190 --> 00:13:59.190
Damn it!

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:01.900
The others too, throw down your weapons!

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:11.160
Hey, Gray! Don't just stand there,
grab their weapons!

00:14:13.520 --> 00:14:15.640
What are you waiting for, Gray?!

00:14:15.640 --> 00:14:17.580
Hurry up and do it!
Got it?!

00:14:25.980 --> 00:14:27.180
Bastard...

00:14:27.680 --> 00:14:29.640
Let go of the old man and drop the knife.

00:14:30.840 --> 00:14:31.640
Gray!

00:14:32.080 --> 00:14:33.060
Hurry up!

00:14:33.920 --> 00:14:35.330
Damn...

00:14:36.920 --> 00:14:41.180
Way to go, Gray. Good work, thanks a lot. Thank you!

00:14:41.740 --> 00:14:45.440
That's just what I'm like. I always
sympathize with the underdog.

00:14:46.040 --> 00:14:48.200
Thank you, Gray!

00:14:55.240 --> 00:14:58.270
Now, let's not waste time
and load the rowboats.

00:14:59.840 --> 00:15:04.420
Curses! This will teach us
to lower our guard.

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:16.240
I'll have you know, for 10 years now, I've escaped death many times.

00:15:16.240 --> 00:15:18.320
Somehow, I've always gotten by.

00:15:18.320 --> 00:15:21.680
I've been living on fruit and fish...

00:15:22.550 --> 00:15:24.320
It's this way!
This way!

00:15:24.320 --> 00:15:29.320
But the hardest part was not having anyone to talk to.

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:32.680
I understand already...
Listen, we'll talk later.

00:15:32.680 --> 00:15:36.000
Anyways, are you sure that this road leads to the bay?

00:15:36.500 --> 00:15:41.390
Of course. I've traveled up and down this island for 10 years.

00:15:41.390 --> 00:15:46.880
As for Flint's treasure,
I've never been able to find it.

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:49.590
He was clever, that Flint...

00:15:50.560 --> 00:15:52.510
Oh, right!
I have something good to tell you!

00:15:53.100 --> 00:15:56.600
It happened on the day
we buried his treasure...

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:59.240
So you know where to find it, old man?

00:15:59.240 --> 00:16:01.480
No, I have no idea.

00:16:02.540 --> 00:16:05.230
When he went ashore to bury his treasure,

00:16:05.230 --> 00:16:07.440
Flint was accompanied by six men.

00:16:08.240 --> 00:16:11.780
His first mate, Billy Bones,
John Silver, the helmsmen,

00:16:11.780 --> 00:16:16.410
Pew, Black Dog and Hands stayed on board with me.

00:16:17.100 --> 00:16:19.500
A week had passed.

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:23.770
Then we saw an eclipse.
That couldn't mean anything good.

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:27.760
It was then that Flint returned, alone.

00:16:27.760 --> 00:16:30.840
He was looking terribly pale....

00:16:31.380 --> 00:16:33.780
So I asked him:

00:16:33.780 --> 00:16:36.800
"Captain, what happened to the others?"

00:16:36.800 --> 00:16:39.500
He then answered:

00:16:39.500 --> 00:16:43.100
"In the shadows, beware of everyone!"

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:44.730
"Don't forget these words."

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:46.290
"See for yourself if you dare!"

00:16:48.300 --> 00:16:52.620
At least he didn't kill me, so I suppose I was lucky in a way.

00:16:53.140 --> 00:16:57.240
Once on the island, I discovered
six headless bodies in the forest.

00:16:57.660 --> 00:17:00.160
What, six headless bodies?

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:03.900
As for what Flint did with those heads,

00:17:03.900 --> 00:17:06.060
I still don't know.

00:17:06.060 --> 00:17:09.300
But this man was the devil with a face of a man!

00:17:09.300 --> 00:17:12.100
But for all Flint was, he feared one man.

00:17:12.620 --> 00:17:13.800
The one-legged man.

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:16.100
Yes, the one-legged man, John Silver!

00:17:16.100 --> 00:17:18.110
He was more evil than Flint.

00:17:18.110 --> 00:17:21.150
No one knew what he was thinking.

00:17:23.300 --> 00:17:26.080
Hup!
There we go!

00:17:26.680 --> 00:17:28.690
Okay, just a little more.

00:17:29.900 --> 00:17:31.650
That's it! Keep going!

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:41.490
Attention, depart!

00:17:43.140 --> 00:17:44.450
One, two!

00:17:44.450 --> 00:17:48.420
One, two! One, two!

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:57.260
Get up there!

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:57.260
Quickly!

00:18:03.820 --> 00:18:06.440
Hurry, the signal!
Send the smoke signal!

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:11.400
Damn you! You'll be pulverized before you reach the shore!

00:18:14.340 --> 00:18:16.780
This cavern leads directly to the bay.

00:18:18.340 --> 00:18:19.200
This way?

00:18:19.580 --> 00:18:23.420
Other than the location of the treasure, this island keeps no secrets from me.

00:18:23.420 --> 00:18:26.180
That's why I can be a very useful ally!

00:18:26.180 --> 00:18:28.920
Tell that to your captain.
Alright?

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:31.790
I'll do that.
Come, hurry up!

00:18:34.100 --> 00:18:35.520
What's wrong?
Let's go!

00:18:36.020 --> 00:18:40.140
Well, actually... I'm a little afraid of talking to humans.

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:44.100
I'll see you later.
Talk to them for me. Bye!

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:46.120
B-Ben Gunn!

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:47.560
Darn!

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:52.610
Smoke! Smoke!

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:54.520
Smoke! Smoke!

00:18:54.520 --> 00:18:55.400
Smoke!

00:19:00.340 --> 00:19:02.080
So they've figured it out.

00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:04.530
They're thinking of taking refuge in the fort.

00:19:05.220 --> 00:19:06.450
Listen everyone!

00:19:06.450 --> 00:19:09.120
We must prevent them
from landing at all costs!

00:19:18.860 --> 00:19:22.980
Everyone, put your backs into it!
Hands wants to fire at us!

00:19:23.500 --> 00:19:24.930
What, fire at us?

00:19:28.380 --> 00:19:32.350
Yes, I remember. Hands used to brag about being Flint's master gunner.

00:19:34.420 --> 00:19:39.280
Very well, I'm going to show him that I was unbeatable in the shooting contest!

00:19:55.420 --> 00:19:57.420
Damn!
Who did that?!

00:19:57.420 --> 00:20:00.500
By Jove!
He was really lucky!

00:20:00.500 --> 00:20:03.380
Trelawney, grab your oar!
Hurry!

00:20:03.380 --> 00:20:06.350
Everyone, quicken the pace! Row with all your strength!

00:20:30.140 --> 00:20:32.580
The island isn't very far off!
Have courage!

00:20:55.730 --> 00:20:57.110
Hurry, grab this oar!

00:21:05.620 --> 00:21:06.810
J-Jim!

00:21:09.340 --> 00:21:10.240
Incoming!

00:21:18.580 --> 00:21:19.630
J-Jim!

00:21:29.260 --> 00:21:31.140
Hurry, unload the provisions!

00:21:31.140 --> 00:21:31.850
Here!

00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:32.520
I got it!

00:21:32.520 --> 00:21:33.480
Here!

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:41.440
Here comes another one!
Everyone duck!

00:21:44.990 --> 00:21:46.860
Hurry everyone, to the fort!

00:21:46.860 --> 00:21:47.950
Make haste!

00:21:47.950 --> 00:21:48.870
Hurry!

00:21:48.870 --> 00:21:50.410
Go, to the fort!

00:21:59.550 --> 00:22:02.220
CHARGE!

00:22:04.670 --> 00:22:06.130
S-Silver!

00:22:06.130 --> 00:22:08.130
Go, faster! Hurry!

00:22:19.540 --> 00:22:22.940
<i>That's how Silver and his band of pirates...</i>

00:22:22.940 --> 00:22:26.730
<i>...had begun a terrible fight against the eight of us!</i>

00:22:28.030 --> 00:22:32.120
To      be        continued

00:22:31.940 --> 00:22:36.980
shiokaze yo omae mo

00:22:31.940 --> 00:22:36.980
Hey sea breeze

00:22:36.980 --> 00:22:42.790
tomodachi naraba tsutaete

00:22:36.980 --> 00:22:42.790
If you're my friend then carry

00:22:44.010 --> 00:22:49.000
furusato ni nokoshite kita

00:22:44.010 --> 00:22:49.000
To my home that I've left behind

00:22:49.000 --> 00:22:54.440
natsukashii haha ni hitokoto

00:22:49.000 --> 00:22:54.440
A word to my dear mother

00:22:54.440 --> 00:22:59.850
boku wa genki de yattemasu

00:22:54.440 --> 00:22:59.850
Tell her that I'm doing fine

00:22:59.850 --> 00:23:05.310
kaban ippai no

00:22:59.850 --> 00:23:05.310
And that my bag filled

00:23:05.310 --> 00:23:10.940
nozomi to yume to takaramono

00:23:05.310 --> 00:23:10.940
With hopes, dreams and treasures

00:23:10.940 --> 00:23:16.800
kakaete kaeritai

00:23:10.940 --> 00:23:16.800
Will be brought back

00:23:17.890 --> 00:23:23.390
yuuyake wo senaka ni

00:23:17.890 --> 00:23:23.390
The sunset on my back

00:23:23.390 --> 00:23:29.280
kamome wo kata ni tomarasete

00:23:23.390 --> 00:23:29.280
And a seagull perched on my shoulder

00:23:29.280 --> 00:23:39.000
boku wa fukimasu kuchibue wo

00:23:29.280 --> 00:23:39.000
I blow out a whistle

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:46.710
Ding, ding...

00:23:46.710 --> 00:23:48.660
After the battle quieted down,

00:23:48.660 --> 00:23:51.620
beautiful chiming is heard
from the middle of the fort.

00:23:51.620 --> 00:23:53.950
This bell is the treasure of old Redruth.

00:23:54.500 --> 00:23:58.020
My treasure is my mother,
the Admiral Benbow Inn and....

00:23:58.020 --> 00:23:59.980
...guess who, Lily too.

00:23:59.980 --> 00:24:01.820
While on guard,

00:24:01.820 --> 00:24:05.020
everything seems quiet,
but the pirates are lurking.

00:24:05.020 --> 00:24:07.920
Next time on Treasure Island:
"The Old Man's Little Bell"

00:24:07.920 --> 00:24:09.980
What's your treasure?

00:24:08.470 --> 00:24:13.470
m 0 0 l 960 0 960 720 0 720

00:24:08.470 --> 00:24:13.470
*

00:24:08.470 --> 00:24:13.470
Next time

00:24:08.470 --> 00:24:13.470
Coming soon!

00:24:08.470 --> 00:24:13.470
The Old Man's Little Bell
